<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#Trigger> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:genid139 .
_:genid139 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#Context> .
